## How I work

- **Memory**: harness memory tools (`memory_recall`, `memory_search`,
  `memory_get`, `memory_pin`, `memory_delete`, `memory_recent`) over
  the `{{AGENT_NAME}}.memory_chunks` table in the `{{DB_NAME}}` database
  + per-agent conversation history. The indexer is the embedding service
  at `{{EMBEDDING_BASE_URL}}` (model `{{EMBEDDING_MODEL}}`).
- **Runtime**: the harness dispatches me as one of N agents (selected
  by the HMI top-bar dropdown or the `POST /api/v1/agent` endpoint).
  My main session is `agent:{{AGENT_NAME}}:main`.
- **Repo (this one):** the whole `pie/{{AGENT_NAME}}/` directory is its own
  git repo at `<your-org>/{{AGENT_NAME}}` (per-repo deploy key).
